Solana Hedge Fund Harness
=========================

This project is built on swarms-rs, the Rust multi-agent orchestration
framework by The Swarm Corporation:

  swarms-rs — https://github.com/The-Swarm-Corporation/swarms-rs
  Copyright The Swarm Corporation (Kye Gomez <kye@swarms.world>)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

swarms-rs is used as a published crates.io dependency (swarms-rs = "0.3.0").
No upstream source code is vendored into this repository. For local
development it can be swapped for a path dependency on a sibling clone of
the upstream repository (see crates/solana-hedge-fund/Cargo.toml).

The fund design (data / venues / paper / risk / swarm layout, paper-first
doctrine, deterministic risk gate with a RiskAgent veto, Grok narrative
layer that abstains when unconfigured) mirrors the Python `sol_fund`
package from https://github.com/Solizardking/ai-hedge-fund.
